{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/randomgraphs\/multigraphs\/directedpseudograph\/scalefree(vertexcount:alpha:beta:gamma:deltain:deltaout:using:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs","doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs\/Multigraphs","doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs\/Multigraphs\/DirectedPseudograph"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs\/Multigraphs\/DirectedPseudograph\/scaleFree(vertexCount:alpha:beta:gamma:deltaIn:deltaOut:using:)"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"scaleFree"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"vertexCount"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"alpha"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0.41, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"beta"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0.54, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"gamma"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0.05, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deltaIn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0.2, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deltaOut"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"using"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"generator"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SG","text":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Multigraphs19DirectedPseudographV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Multigraphs\/documentation\/Multigraphs\/DirectedPseudograph","text":"DirectedPseudograph"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Béla Bollobás, Christian Borgs, Jennifer Chayes and Oliver Riordan. Directed scale-free","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"graphs. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Proceedings of the 14th ACM–SIAM Symposium on Discrete Algorithms","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (SODA 2003),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"132–139.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It starts from the directed cycle 0 → 1 → 2 → 0 and adds one arc per step until there are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertexCount"},{"type":"text","text":" vertices. With probability α the step adds a new vertex v → w; with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"probability β an arc v → w between existing vertices; otherwise (γ) an arc v → w to a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex w. An existing source is drawn with probability proportional to its out-degree plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deltaOut"},{"type":"text","text":", an existing target to its in-degree plus "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deltaIn"},{"type":"text","text":": with probability"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nδ\/(nδ + m) a uniform vertex (new ones included), else the source (or target) of a uniform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arc. New vertices take the next number. Self-loops and parallel arcs occur. The arcs are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<m"},{"type":"text","text":" in the order they were added, the cycle first."}]},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(m) expected, with m ≈ (n − 3)\/(α + γ) + 3 arcs."}]}]},{"name":"Precondition","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"vertexCount ≥ 3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; α, β and γ positive, summing to 1 within 10⁻⁹; and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"deltaIn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"deltaOut","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" non-negative and finite.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The directed scale-free graph of Bollobás, Borgs, Chayes and Riordan, whose in- and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out-degrees both follow power laws:"}],"metadata":{"conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"Vertex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"externalID":"s:11Multigraphs19DirectedPseudographV12RandomGraphsSiRszrlE9scaleFree11vertexCount5alpha4beta5gamma7deltaIn0M3Out5usingACySiGSi_S5dqd__ztSGRd__lFZ","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ScaleFree.swift","url":"h